== Behavior ==
When caught, '''Nessie''' spawns in the {{zone|Murkwater Loch}} regardless of catch location. It deals damage in a {{InfoNeeded}} block area around it. Upon reaching {{Stat|HP|1m}}, it shrinks, becomes invulnerable, and swims into the {{Zone|Murkwater Depths}}. It either swims to the {{Zone|Driptoad Delve}} or the {{Zone|Dragon's Lair (galatea)}}. Once it reaches its destination, it will rapidly enlarge until it can once again be damaged, also attempting to attack the player once it has fully enlarged.

