=== Loot Sharing ===
Loot Sharing with [[Nessie]]s treats all drops obtained by the player who kills the Nessie as 100% drops, causing the same drops to be given to all players participating in Loot Sharing.

== Bestiary ==
{{Bestiary Entry|section=Moonglade Marsh|lore=Whispers of a monster lurking in the loch permeate Galatea.|bracket=8|max_tier=15}}

== Trivia ==
*'''Nessie''' is based on the Loch Ness Monster from Scottish folklore, which is also commonly named Nessie.
*Attacking '''Nessie''' with a {{Item|Soul Whip}} or {{Item|Flaming Flay}} during its invulnerability phase counts as ghost damage towards [[Loot Share]] requirements.

== Bugs ==
* {{Item|Nessie Shard}} is not a guaranteed drop even if the killer has an active [[Salts|Salt]].{{ConfirmationNeeded}}
*If one player drops an item from '''Nessie''', all players eligible for [[Loot Share]] receive it as well.{{ConfirmationNeeded}}

